        "text_7h6LaE": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Our story began more than 30 years ago, when a talented English teacher – Carrol Boyes – decided to pursue her passion for art and sculpture. Since the inception of the brand, our products can be found in the homes of South African collectors and abroad. Carrol Boyes is a trusted and celebrated brand; we pride ourselves in exceptional quality and recognizable style.</p>",
