        },
        "text_BgJnW3": {
          "type": "text",
          "settings": {
            "text": "<p>Over the years Carrol has been recognised and acknowledged for her incredible achievements in business and contributions to the design world. The Carrol Boyes group draws its talented complement of people and vendors from all over the country to provide excellence in quality and functionality. With decades of sketches in the archive and personally selected designers who worked alongside her for many years, the brand is only set to reach new heights with each year that passes and ensuring that Carrol’s legacy lives on in her designs.</p>",
            "text_size": "text-base",
            "text_line_limit": "none",
            "button_style": "btn--underline",
